WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
Market tens

2
00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:12.633
Today we are at the market. The seller packs oranges in tens. How many is one ten and some more?

3
00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:16.567
One full ten frame is ten.

4
00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:19.600
Then four more.

5
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.833
Ten and four is fourteen.
